Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you wanna fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon,\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI'd want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place I want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon my sword with fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite splendid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Best remember the name Pretzel You're\Nseeing a one-of-a-kind masterpiece
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to teach you a lesson On\Nhow we run things in the new world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you call it one of a kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you holding six of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you've\Ngotten into, pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't forget they work for Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We really shouldn't take this lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised even Luffy's\Nhaving a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.98,0:05:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, little missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you can't retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart must be pounding in\Nyour throat by now, poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Worst generation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, whoop-de-doo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you all had a good time playing\Npirates cruising the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen countless faces of\Nunderlings like you come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,always spouting the same nonsense that\Ntheir captain will be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how that story ends? In despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You all wander into Mama's\Nterritory and learn the same lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Kid did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Roar of the Sea, Apu, Gang\NBuggy, and even Mad Monk-Aruge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Buggy recognized the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He had enough wits about\Nhim to join forces with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of those pathetic\Nworst-generation upstarts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,were driven away without even\Ncatching a glimpse of Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, one of them had some backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Mad Monk-Aruge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The scoundrel was crafty enough to take\Ndown one of our strongest officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe they were the Sweet\NFour generals, not so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's as far as he made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama was so furious she sent\Nbrother Cracker to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend has nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine he must be taking\Nhis last breath by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reached your final\Nstop in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight an\Nemperor? Really? You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't even get close to Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Infiltrating the tea party,\Nstopping the wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and then walking out of here\Nalive with your lost Gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, like that's\Never going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This forest will be your final resting\Nplace without ever catching sight of Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my climb attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Mirror World.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to love it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to old Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to carve up that little\Nface in the comfort of another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go, Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You just committed treason against Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon, just dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a thunderbolt tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be back as always, huh? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, her ability lets her appear\Npretty much any place that has a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, are you in trouble now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I was already in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cracker was told to kill me\Nby none other than Lin-Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it just reminded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Lola's friends, by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I would say that officially\Nsettles it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's mother has to be Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that the creatures here have such\Na reaction to this is proof in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to put\Nit to good use, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in his pathway!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget we still have a duty\Nto uphold us the seducing ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let anyone escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Plunk is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,God, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard biscuit block!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using armament Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly care about Vinsmok Sanji as\Na friend, surely you should let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the prince of a mighty kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His status far exceeds your own, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By taking a noble wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,he can enjoy living in luxury\Nwith every desire catered to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you rather selfishly\Ntake your friend back or
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,allow him to partake in the\Nhappiness he is entitled to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to his new family,\Nyou're childish and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine what a prince would\Nsay looking upon a failure like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight, you\Nwretched low-class pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Muscle balloon! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle Balloon isn't a bad name\Ncoming from a simpleton like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But bouncing balls don't exactly\Nstrike fear into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me spell it out one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're low class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, gum, gum, gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard biscuit block!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know Sanji at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You insult him, even if he is happy with\Nhis new life and doesn't want to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd never talk to us like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until I save Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't push your luck with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong! Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,General Prattler!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that impressed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I already introduced myself\Nas the Sweet Three General Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my favorite armor,\Nyou know. Armor? Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him cough up blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a true craftsman at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It even tasted good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After consuming the bis-bis\Nfruit, I became a biscuit man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I make infinite amounts of\Nbiscuits and manipulate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The possibilities are endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Crushed biscuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can imagine it, I can craft it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look familiar, the face\Nof a hardened warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Much like biscuits through history,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they change shapes based on the\Nera or the whims of their creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not many people have ever caught\Na glimpse of my true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my wanted poster\Nthat's issued by the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I detest the feeling of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same goes for injections.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I surround myself in a suit of\Narmor and control it to fight in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It multiplies as I clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the height of artisanal biscuitry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Limitless forces at my disposal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you struggled\Nso hard to destroy was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but a single biscuit\Nwarrior in a line of many.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can duplicate them as\Nmany times as I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand why you will\Nnever see Vinsmoke Sanji again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see Soji! You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, no matter how strong you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there are people out\Nthere you can never beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning to accept that\Ndoesn't mean you've failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You still want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stick around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.18,0:19:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't get a chad, noooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we'll be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really no point\Nin us sticking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You could try it, but\Nthere will be consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you all to\Nhelp out Luffy with Cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many of you wither,\Nit won't bother me one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say something\Nthat awful with a smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're afraid of General Cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about Big Mom, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is scarier?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I smarter or what? Here, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I got this all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,From this point on, you can call\Nme your Big Bro Chopper, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what's the thing you figured out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My Cho-Bro, your Cho-Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's short for Big\NBro Chopper. Cho-Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like this world\Nis actually connected
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to all the mirrors on Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you, Tia, are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:22:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe instead of escaping, we should\Nuse Brule's ability to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we can see everything, let's\Ntry to locate Sanji. That's brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Chobro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That compliment doesn't make me\Nhappy at all, you little scamp you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret song, whirlwind slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say that we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After their patrol route, the\NBiscuit warriors go back to the Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We will strike then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy anything that gets\Nbetween me and Sanji, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.04,0:24:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.66,0:24:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey pretzels!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.26,0:24:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.72,0:24:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a very busy day ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First on the agenda,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.26,0:24:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the Vinsmoke family will be stopping\Nby to attend the engagement ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.66,0:24:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have an update on\Nthe wedding cake yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That comes tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:25:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire night has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.94,0:25:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How are those irksome little gnats doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.10,0:25:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They have one last chance\Nto meet with their Gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some doubts, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know they don't stand a\Nchance against General Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Blackleg steps into this\Ncastle, the deed is as good as done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their chance of meeting him is zilch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the tea party and wedding will\Nboth be held within these very walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're all talk then, like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still waiting on a few\NVinsmokes to arrive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.98,0:25:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, actually, I've received word\Nthat they just landed at the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.54,0:25:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good news indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my beloved sons are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.72,0:25:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot wait to see\Nthem face off with Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Nijiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Nijiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.56,0:26:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.16,0:26:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they ended\Nthat long war on Rock Crusade!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he coming out to greet us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.02,0:26:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Niji.
